  "description": "PromptWars X AITH Welcome to PromptWars X AITH , a student-led innovation initiative designed to bring together creative minds, AI enthusiasts, developers, and problem solvers. The hackathon focuses on Artificial Intelligence, Prompt Engineering, creativity, and innovation. Participants will get an opportunity to showcase their skills, experiment with AI tools, collaborate, and develop innovative solutions. Event Highlights AI and Prompt Engineering challenges. Showcase your creativity and problem-solving skills. Compete with talented innovators. Opportunity to participate in an offline hackathon round at the college campus. Learn, collaborate, build, and innovate. Event Format The initial participation and evaluation process will be conducted online. Shortlisted teams will be invited to the college campus for the offline round. Event Date 23rd (as per the announced event schedule). Organised By AITD Events Community & Initiative PromptWars X AITH is an initiative to encourage students to explore the possibilities of AI-powered innovation and practical problem-solving. Think. Prompt. Build. Win.",
