    "details": "<p><strong>PromptWars X AITH</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>PromptWars X AITH</strong>, a student-led innovation initiative designed to bring together creative minds, AI enthusiasts, developers, and problem solvers.</p>\n<p>The hackathon focuses on Artificial Intelligence, Prompt Engineering, creativity, and innovation. Participants will get an opportunity to showcase their skills, experiment with AI tools, collaborate, and develop innovative solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI and Prompt Engineering challenges.</li>\n<li>Showcase your creativity and problem-solving skills.</li>\n<li>Compete with talented innovators.</li>\n<li>Opportunity to participate in an offline hackathon round at the college campus.</li>\n<li>Learn, collaborate, build, and innovate.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Format</strong></p>\n<p>The initial participation and evaluation process will be conducted online. Shortlisted teams will be invited to the college campus for the offline round.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Date</strong></p>\n<p>23rd (as per the announced event schedule).</p>\n<p><strong>Organised By</strong></p>\n<p><strong>AITD Events</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Community &amp; Initiative</strong></p>\n<p>PromptWars X AITH is an initiative to encourage students to explore the possibilities of AI-powered innovation and practical problem-solving.</p>\n<p><strong>Think. Prompt. Build. Win.</strong></p>",
